| `KEEL_MCP_MODEL` | string | unset: the registry default, and the server writes `[using default] KEEL_MCP_MODEL = null` to stderr | a model name from `models/`, not blank | `mcp/qa_server.py` (`configured_model`), through `scripts/config_loader.py`'s `KEEL_MCP_MODEL` row | Chooses the model the question-answering MCP server answers with. | the hooks' model: their `--model` flag | always |
